 "caption": "Good setup. Wrong price. You bought PREMIUM. 💸\n\nAfter an impulse, the upper half of the leg is premium and the lower half is discount. Buying at 90% of the move puts your stop inside the normal retracement, so you get shaken out right before price continues from discount.\n\n1️⃣ Mark the 50% of the leg\n2️⃣ Buy only in discount\n3️⃣ Sell only in premium\n\nFollow @institutionalmetatrading for a new SMC rule every day.\n\nEducational content. Not financial advice.\n\n#smartmoneyconcepts #smc #premiumdiscount #ict #priceaction #riskmanagement #daytrading #forex"
